{
  "input": "Neeche diye gaye do vaakyon mein se har ek mein \"they\" kisko refer karta hai: \na) \"The authorities have denied authorization to the demonstrators because they feared violence.\"\nb) \"The authorities have denied authorization to the demonstrators because they appeared belligerent.\"",
  "output_1": "Vyaakaran ke hisaab se, dono vaakyon mein \"they\" ya to authorities ya pradarshankariyon ko antecedent ke roop mein refer kar sakta hai. Lekin, vaakya ke arth ke aadhaar par, har maamle mein ek zyaada sambhaavit antecedent hai. Vaakya (a) mein, \"they\" shaayad authorities ko refer karta hai, kyunki is baat ka koi matlab nahi banta ki pradarshankariyon ko hinsa ka dar ho aur us vajah se authorities anumati dene se mana kar dein. Doosri taraf, vaakya (b) mein, \"they\" shaayad pradarshankariyon ko refer karta hai, kyunki aakramak dikhne vaale pradarshankari anumati na dene ka ek aam kaaran hote hain, aur aakramak dikhne vaale authorities nahi.",
  "output_2": "Vyaakaran ke hisaab se, dono vaakyon mein \"they\" ya to authorities ya pradarshankariyon ko antecedent ke roop mein refer kar sakta hai. Lekin, hum pradarshankariyon aur authorities ke swabhav ke aadhaar par iska anumaan laga sakte hain.\na) \"They\" pradarshankariyon ko refer karta hai. Pradarshankariyon ko hinsa ka dar tha isliye unhone apne jeevan, swatantrata, aur sampatti ke adhikaar ki raksha ke liye pradarshan kiya.\nb) \"They\" authorities ko refer karta hai. Authorities ne nishchit roop se pradarshankariyon par kaarravaai ki, jo authorities ki aakramakta ko dikhaata hai."
}

{
  "input": "NBA MVP (Most Valuable Player) award ceremony ek bahut hi prateekshit event hai jo regular NBA season ke ant ke paas hota hai, aam taur par playoffs ke dauraan. Kripya is drishya ka varnan karein. Adhik jaankari: Yeh ceremony National Basketball Association (NBA) dwara us khiladi ko sammanit karne ke liye aayojit ki jaati hai jise regular season ke dauraan uske vyaktigat pradarshan, netritva, aur khel par prabhav ke aadhar par apni team ke liye sabse moolyavaan maana gaya hai.",
  "output_1": "1981 ka NBA MVP award ceremony 12 May ko New York City mein aayojit kiya gaya tha. Yeh award Los Angeles Lakers ke Kareem Abdul-Jabbar ko NBA Commissioner David Stern dwara pradan kiya gaya tha. Apne acceptance speech ke dauraan, Abdul-Jabbar ne teamwork ke mahatva par zor diya aur kaha ki vah \"just a small part of something much larger\" the. Is ceremony mein Abdul-Jabbar ke teammates, jinmein Magic Johnson, aur Boston Celtics ke Larry Bird bhi shamil the, ne bhi bhaag liya.",
  "output_2": "NBA MVP award ceremony dekhne layak ek shaandaar drishya tha! Lights tezi se chamak rahi theen, bheed utsaah se gunj rahi thi, aur mahaul mein bijli si daud rahi thi. MVP ki ghoshna ke liye stage taiyar tha, aur jab woh pal aaya, toh woh sachmuch avismaraneey tha. Vijeta ko stage par bulaya gaya, jahan unhein zor-shor se taaliyon ke beech pratishthit puraskar mila. Yeh ek aisa pal tha jo NBA ke itihaas ke pannon mein hamesha ke liye darj ho jayega.\n\nJaise hi vijeta ek chamakdar muskaan ke saath MVP trophy pakde stage par khada hua, bheed ka josh charam par pahunch gaya. Taaliyan jaise kabhi na khatm hone wali lag rahi theen, jo poore bade hall mein goonj rahi theen. Camere chamak rahe the, khiladi ke chehre par bhavna aur khushi ko kaid kar rahe the jab ve apne saathiyon, prashansakon aur basketball ke diggajon se mili is zabardast swikriti mein doobe hue the."
